  "display_title": "Taming an Alpha Dog",
  "description": "Born a natural-born alpha with a silver spoon in his mouth, Hui-Won had been living a carefree, debauched life that was the envy of all. Escaping his father’s gaze, who wanted him to take over the family business, he flees to a small village, where he meets a handsome young man named Yi-Ji. Contrary to Hui-Won’s expectations of seducing Yi-Ji for a steamy night, Yi-Ji brings his dog food and a leash himself, introducing himself as the “director of a dogfighting training camp”…\n\n*“I thought you were some kind of mutt, but you’re just a dog in heat, aren’t you?”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
